Read-path diagnostics for the eMMC wall (see patch 0110's benchmark, which
measured ~15 KiB/s with HS/50 MHz/8-bit on):

  * print EXT_CSD health/state (HS_TIMING, BUS_WIDTH, PRE_EOL_INFO,
    DEVICE_LIFE_TIME_EST A/B, BKOPS_EN/STATUS, CACHE_CTRL/SIZE);
  * emmcroot_rdprof=<n> profiles the first n block reads phase by phase
    (command->BRR, data drain, TC, DAT idle) in microseconds;
  * emmcroot_bench2=<MiB> repeats the 0110 benchmark at +30 GiB inside the
    partition (outside the 20 GiB image).

Base: tmp/onc_emmc_after_0110.c (= CI main after 0110).  Only
bsd/dev/onc_emmc.c changes.
